@gongminmin I'm wondering what specifically you are referring to? Is there a document/reference that you can point us to?

If you're referring to using `[shader(...)]` for raytracing purposes, it is supported ([example](https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/blob/master/tools/clang/test/CodeGenSPIRV/raytracing.nv.library.hlsl)). 

If you're referring to a more broad scope, can you please provide an example and/or the lib_6_* doc/spec?
